**/node_modules
**/dist
.git

# Python: a local virtualenv is hundreds of megabytes and must never reach the build
# context, and caches would invalidate layers for no reason.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Never build secrets into an image.
.env
.env.*
infra/*.local.env

# Development and evaluation only - the stand-in geodata server must never ship
# (docs/protocol.md#waiting-for-the-production-mcp-server). Excluded from the context as
# well as uncopied, so a future `COPY mcp_dummy` fails the build instead of silently
# putting it back in the image.
mcp_dummy
evals
backend/tests
